## 1.1.0 - 2026-10-16

The last minor release supporting Python 3.9 and 3.10.

- Python 3.13 and 3.14 support. The Python requirement is now >=3.9 rather than a list of versions.
- SQLAlchemy 2.1 support (now >=2.0.23,<2.2). Account codes, transaction numbers and reporting period counts were wrong on SQLAlchemy 2.1.
- Fix bulk assignment raising NegativeValueError when the assignable transaction runs out before the last outstanding transaction (#22).
- Account schedules and aging schedules only count assignments made up to the report end date (#21).
- Fix inclusive tax in transaction summaries (#26) and inclusive tax posting with integer rates (#27).
- Fix the indentation of the return statement in FinancialStatement._print_section (#17).
- Fix the config import in the README (#6).
- Releases are tested on Python 3.9 to 3.14 and published to PyPI from GitHub releases (#24).

